# Keep the Docker build context small. Without this, every `docker build`
# uploads the whole node_modules tree and every build artifact, which
# makes builds 10x slower and frequently blows out the daemon's memory.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage

# TypeScript incremental-build state. If these ship in the Docker context,
# `tsc` decides its outputs are already up-to-date and emits NOTHING — the
# runner stage then fails with "/app/apps/server/dist: not found".
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/dev.db
**/dev.db-journal
**/prisma/*.db
**/prisma/*.db-journal
**/apps/server/scripts/inspect-db.mjs
backups/
docs/
.github/
.husky/
.turbo/
docker/
infra/
